        {
          "text": "Thɛp Kuɔth Nhial",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gat ran, locni nhiamdu kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kä lat ruac kɛ kui̱ gua̱thni tin la pal naath thi̱n. Kä lat ruac go̱o̱kä mi jiääk kɛ kui̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n I-thɛ-rɛl, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "läri jɛ mun I-thɛ-rɛl ɛn ɣöö ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial bëë kä yɛ mɔ, kä bä thɛpdä ka̱m raar go̱kädɛ, kä bä nɛy tin tekɛ cuŋ kɛnɛ nɛy tin tekɛ dueer ŋuɔ̱k raar rɛydun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bä ji̱ cuŋni kɛnɛ ji̱ dueeri ŋuɔ̱k raar rɛydun, kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, bä thɛpdä ka̱m raar rɛy go̱kädɛ, kä bä nɛy diaal tin te kui̱c cuëëc a wä mäni kui̱c caam mak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi nɛy diaal ɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial ci thɛpdɛ ka̱m raar go̱kädɛ mɔ. Kä /ca jɛ bi nyɔk kɛ loc go̱kädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ ku pa̱r lö gat ran kɛ jiɛ̈th lɔaac mi di̱i̱t kɛnɛ jiääk lɔaac mi di̱i̱t nhiam nath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä kɛn ji̱ wä thi̱ec i̱, ‘Ɛŋu mɔ päri mɔ?’ Bikɛ jiök i̱, ‘Ɛ ɣöö tëë kɛ ruac mi ci ben. Mi laar jɛ ɛn ɣöö bi lo̱c diaal ŋɛ̈ɛ̈r, kä bɛ tet diaal nuäŋ. Bi naath lo̱ckiɛn baath, kä bi mua̱a̱l kɔ̱c ce̱tnikɛ pi̱. Nɛ̈nɛ jɛ ja bëëni, kä bɛ dhil tuɔɔk ɛ puc, ruac ni ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
