          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gat ran, lat ruac go̱o̱kä, latdɛ ɛn ɣöö Kuäär ni Kuoth laarɛ jɛ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Car mɛmɛ, mi ci luik Kuɔth lo̱k, bi ti̱ti̱ tuɔɔk kä ji̱ ɛ puc. Ruac ni ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thɛp kua̱r Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gat ran, lätni duɔ̱p da̱ŋ rɛw ti bi ben kɛ thɛp kua̱r Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, kä kɛn duɔ̱p da̱ŋ rɛw a kɛ tuɔkɛ rɔ̱ wi̱c kɛl. Kä lätni nyuuthni guäth in dääk duɔ̱p rɔ̱ thi̱n, min wä duɔ̱ɔ̱p kɛl wi̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä moc duɔ̱ɔ̱p kɛl kɛ nyuuth mi bi thɛp wä kɛ jɛ kä Rɛ̈-baa ro̱o̱l ji̱ Am-on, kiɛ mi wä Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm wi̱i̱ tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ben cuɔ̱ŋ guäth in dääk duɔ̱p rɔ̱ thi̱n, röm duɔ̱pni da̱ŋ rɛw tui̱th ɛ. Kä jɛn yorɛ bääri ala gaakni, kä thiecɛ kuthkɛ. Kä guicɛ cueny lɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ in cɛ thöp ala muc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gaak in te tetdä cuëëcdɛ nyuthɛ jɛ ɣöö bɛ wä kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä bɛ ŋuɔ̱ɔ̱ny jiɛn ka̱n, bɛ thi̱i̱k Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm dhiäm kɛ kɛ, kä bɛ wä kɛ jɔw köör, kä latdɛ ruac mi tho̱pɛ näk nath. Kä bɛ ko̱o̱tni la̱t ti wä wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱ny kä bɛ wec cu mak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ci ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm mɛmɛ bi ŋäth, kɛ ɣöö cikɛ ruac mat kɛ döör ti kɔ̱ŋ kɛ ɣöö bakɛ ben luäk. Duundɛ ɣöö bi kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kɛ jakä tiɛmkɛ dueerkiɛn, kä bɛ kɛ naŋ ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ mɛmɛ ɛ min lar Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial ɛ wëë i̱, “Bi yɛn dueerkun tim kɛ ɣöö dueerkun jɔckɛ rɛy lätnikun diaal, kä kɛ ɣöö cia nyuɔɔnkun ŋa̱c, ba yɛ naŋ ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä kɛ kui̱dun yɛn ruëëc I-thɛ-rɛl ti ji̱ nyuɔɔni ti ca rɔ̱ ya̱r, yɛn nɛy tin ci cäŋdun cop, min la gua̱a̱th tɔ̱ŋädun in jɔak, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mɛmɛ ɛ min lär Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial ɛ yɛ wëë i̱, ‘Wuɔcɛ kuɔ̱mni wuɔ̱thnikun, wuɔcɛ kuɔ̱mni kuäärä, /ci ŋɔak bi ŋot kɛ ta̱a̱diɛn. Nɛy tin gɔw täämɛ, bakɛ jakä jiäk, kä nɛy tin jiäk bakɛ jakä gɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ da̱k, ɛ da̱k, ɛ da̱k ɣän bä jɛ la̱t! (Jɛn ɛ mi /ken met tuɔɔk.) Amäni mi ci ram mi lot rɔ kɛ kuäär ben, ɣän bä cu ka̱m jɛ.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thɛp Kuɔth kɛ kui̱ ji̱ Am-on",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱n lö gat ran lat ruac go̱o̱kä, kä lätni naath min ci Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial ɛ lat kɛ kui̱ ji̱ Am-on tin kuëthkɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ rieet wäkɛ i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
